      "description": "Sculptural asymmetric tile for a single hero metric and its status.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-stat-card\"><div class=\"ds-stat-card-top\"><span class=\"ds-stat-label\">CGPA</span><span class=\"ds-stat-icon\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#A8C7FA\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M12 3L2 9l10 6 10-6-10-6z\"/></svg></span></div><div class=\"ds-stat-value\">8.74</div><div class=\"ds-stat-sub\">6.8 credits earned</div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-stat-card{background:#0F1014;border-radius:26px 10px 26px 10px;padding:12px 14px;min-width:180px}.ds-stat-card-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}.ds-stat-label{font:700 10px Roboto,sans-serif;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#C4C6D0}.ds-stat-icon{width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:9999px;background:#0842A0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}.ds-stat-value{font:900 24px Roboto,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-0.5px;color:#A8C7FA;margin-top:6px}.ds-stat-sub{font:500 11px/13px Roboto,sans-serif;color:#C4C6D0}"
